<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Die.</font>

32
00:01:35,070 --> 00:01:36,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn!</font>

33
00:01:36,820 --> 00:01:38,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

34
00:01:42,450 --> 00:01:47,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmm... Shadow Clone Jutsu.
And there are quite a few of them.</font>

35
00:02:11,190 --> 00:02:12,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here I go!</font>

36
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:33,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's impossible, after all...</font>

37
00:02:34,340 --> 00:02:36,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There is no way that
you can beat a guy!</font>

38
00:02:40,510 --> 00:02:43,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There is only one way left
to defeat this guy.</font>

39
00:02:44,390 --> 00:02:45,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke!</font>

40
00:02:49,940 --> 00:02:50,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see!</font>

41
00:02:50,770 --> 00:02:52,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So that's your plan, Naruto!</font>

42
00:02:52,980 --> 00:02:54,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's pretty good for you!</font>

43
00:03:09,660 --> 00:03:10,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Demon Wind Shuriken,</font>

44
00:03:11,370 --> 00:03:12,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Windmill of Shadows...</font>

45
00:03:21,430 --> 00:03:24,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A Shuriken won't work on me.</font>

46
00:03:39,690 --> 00:03:40,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see.</font>

47
00:03:41,650 --> 00:03:44,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This time it's aiming for my real body...</font>

48
00:03:45,620 --> 00:03:46,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

49
00:03:46,870 --> 00:03:47,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not so easy!</font>

50
00:03:51,660 --> 00:03:53,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A Shuriken in the Shuriken's shadow!</font>

51
00:03:54,210 --> 00:03:54,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is...</font>

52
00:03:55,540 --> 00:03:57,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Shadow Shuriken Jutsu!</font>

53
00:03:58,630 --> 00:04:00,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A second Shuriken in his blind spot!</font>

54
00:04:09,350 --> 00:04:10,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

55
00:04:11,890 --> 00:04:13,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Still too naive.</font>

56
00:04:15,020 --> 00:04:16,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He dodged it!</font>

57
00:04:28,490 --> 00:04:30,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here it is!</font>

58
00:04:30,120 --> 00:04:36,130
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5"><font size="50">Kakashi the</font></font>

59
00:04:30,120 --> 00:04:36,130
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5"><font size="50">Sharingan User</font></font>

60
00:05:03,490 --> 00:05:05,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You little brat!</font>

61
00:05:20,960 --> 00:05:22,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kakashi-sensei!</font>

62
00:05:28,510 --> 00:05:29,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

63
00:05:30,220 --> 00:05:32,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your strategy was outstanding.</font>

64
00:05:33,100 --> 00:05:35,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You've grown up...
Both of you.</font>

65
00:05:37,650 --> 00:05:41,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The purpose of the Shadow Clones
was not to take down Zabuza,</font>

66
00:05:41,770 --> 00:05:46,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but to hide my transformation
into Demon Wind Shuriken!</font>

67
00:06:02,500 --> 00:06:06,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I left one clone behind, then
transformed into Demon Wind Shuriken.</font>

68
00:06:19,310 --> 00:06:22,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then a clone threw the real me, who had
transformed into Demon Wind Shuriken,</font>

69
00:06:22,650 --> 00:06:23,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">towards Sasuke!</font>

70
00:06:24,400 --> 00:06:25,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke!</font>

71
00:06:29,070 --> 00:06:30,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When Sasuke got me,</font>

72
00:06:30,360 --> 00:06:32,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he must have realized
right away who I was.</font>

73
00:06:32,740 --> 00:06:34,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then he took out his own Shuriken...</font>

74
00:06:34,620 --> 00:06:36,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And that's the Shadow Shuriken Jutsu!</font>

75
00:06:45,170 --> 00:06:46,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Demon Wind Shuriken...</font>

76
00:06:47,130 --> 00:06:48,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Windmill of Shadows!</font>

77
00:06:51,220 --> 00:06:55,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hidden in the shadow of the real Shuriken,
I aimed for Zabuza.</font>

78
00:06:55,930 --> 00:06:59,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Of course I didn't think
I would defeat Zabuza!</font>

79
00:07:00,270 --> 00:07:02,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I thought I'd destroy
the Water Prison.</font>

80
00:07:03,230 --> 00:07:05,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And as a bonus
I defeated his water clone, too...</font>

81
00:07:05,940 --> 00:07:07,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was a huge success!</font>

82
00:07:08,570 --> 00:07:10,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was a fluke...</font>

83
00:07:10,570 --> 00:07:12,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was a fluke, huh!</font>

84
00:07:13,240 --> 00:07:16,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Still, they performed outstandingly
in tandem...</font>

85
00:07:16,490 --> 00:07:17,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in this desperate situation.</font>

86
00:07:19,410 --> 00:07:20,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Despite the fact...</font>

87
00:07:20,790 --> 00:07:22,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that those two always
fight like cats and dogs.</font>

88
00:07:23,750 --> 00:07:24,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmph...</font>

89
00:07:24,500 --> 00:07:27,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I got distracted and
broke my Water Prison Jutsu...</font>

90
00:07:28,130 --> 00:07:29,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's not it!</font>

91
00:07:29,760 --> 00:07:31,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You didn't break the Jutsu...</font>

92
00:07:32,680 --> 00:07:33,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They forced you to break it.</font>

93
00:07:42,270 --> 00:07:46,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll tell you now,
the same Jutsu won't work on me twice.</font>

94
00:07:47,610 --> 00:07:49,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So what will you do?</font>

95
00:08:00,660 --> 00:08:02,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura!
Stay alert.</font>

96
