<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sharingan!</font>

97
00:08:41,290 --> 00:08:44,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ushi, saru, u.
Ne, inoshishi, Tori, ushi.</font>

98
