<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mi, inoshishi, hitsuji Ne...</font>

100
00:08:50,210 --> 00:08:52,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ushi, saru, u.
Ne, inoshishi, Tori, ushi.</font>

101
