<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uma, Tori, Ne, Tora.
Inu, Tora, mi, ushi, hitsuji.</font>

102
00:08:56,320 --> 00:08:57,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mi, inoshishi, hitsuji Ne.</font>

103
00:08:59,180 --> 00:09:02,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jin, saru, Tori, tatsu.
Tori, ushi, uma, hitsuji.</font>

104
00:09:02,080 --> 00:09:04,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tora, mi, Ne, saru.
U, inoshishi, tatsu, hitsuji.</font>

105
00:09:04,520 --> 00:09:07,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Ne, ushi, saru, Tori. Jin, Ne, inoshishi.
— Jin, saru, Tori, tatsu. Tori, ushi, uma, hitsuji.</font>

106
00:09:07,700 --> 00:09:10,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tora, mi, Ne, saru.
U, inoshishi, tatsu, hitsuji.</font>

107
00:09:10,170 --> 00:09:12,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ne, ushi, saru, Tori.
Jin, Ne, inoshishi.</font>

108
00:09:12,570 --> 00:09:13,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tori!</font>

109
00:09:17,700 --> 00:09:19,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Water Style!
Water Dragon Jutsu!</font>

110
00:09:51,110 --> 00:09:53,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He copied that chant
in seconds...</font>

111
00:09:54,150 --> 00:09:55,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and so perfectly...!</font>

112
00:09:57,660 --> 00:09:59,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What is this?</font>

113
00:09:59,490 --> 00:10:00,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is it Ninjutsu!</font>

114
00:10:18,630 --> 00:10:19,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Strange...</font>

115
00:10:20,180 --> 00:10:21,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is going on...?</font>

116
00:10:23,070 --> 00:10:25,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jin, saru, Tori, tatsu.
Tori, ushi, uma, hitsuji.</font>

117
00:10:25,430 --> 00:10:27,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tora, mi, Ne, saru.
U, inoshishi, tatsu, hitsuji.</font>

118
00:10:27,350 --> 00:10:31,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Sharingan is the ability to memorize
and copy the enemy's Jutsu...</font>

119
00:10:32,400 --> 00:10:33,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

120
00:10:33,900 --> 00:10:34,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tori!</font>

121
00:10:38,860 --> 00:10:40,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Water Style!
Water Dragon Jutsu!</font>

122
00:10:41,870 --> 00:10:44,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Jutsu was set in motion
at the same time!</font>

123
00:10:45,910 --> 00:10:47,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">By any chance, is this guy...</font>

124
00:11:11,190 --> 00:11:12,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This guy...!</font>

125
00:11:35,840 --> 00:11:37,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The same identical movement!</font>

126
00:11:38,130 --> 00:11:40,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Furthermore, at exactly
the same time!</font>

127
00:11:42,180 --> 00:11:43,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's going on, Sasuke-kun!</font>

128
00:11:51,350 --> 00:11:52,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This guy...</font>

129
00:11:53,350 --> 00:11:54,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My movements...!</font>

130
00:11:56,230 --> 00:11:57,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's perfectly...</font>

131
00:11:58,820 --> 00:12:00,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Reading them.</font>

132
00:12:01,150 --> 00:12:02,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

133
00:12:02,400 --> 00:12:04,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's reading my mind?!</font>

134
00:12:09,450 --> 00:12:11,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Blast him! He's...</font>

135
00:12:12,370 --> 00:12:15,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">giving me
that barren, evil eye... right?</font>

136
00:12:19,420 --> 00:12:23,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hah! You're just copying...
You're a pale imitation.</font>

137
00:12:24,180 --> 00:12:26,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— You won't be able to beat me!
— You won't be able to beat me!</font>

138
00:12:26,850 --> 00:12:27,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— You!
— You!</font>

139
00:12:28,850 --> 00:12:32,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll shut that copycat
monkey-mouth permanently!</font>

140
00:12:37,730 --> 00:12:39,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What's that!</font>

141
00:12:45,740 --> 00:12:46,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Me?</font>

142
00:12:47,450 --> 00:12:49,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">R-Ridiculous!</font>

143
00:12:50,410 --> 00:12:52,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that his Genjutsu?</font>

144
00:12:55,330 --> 00:12:57,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Water Style!
Giant Vortex Jutsu!</font>

145
00:13:05,380 --> 00:13:06,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-Wha...!</font>

146
00:13:12,390 --> 00:13:13,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way!</font>

147
00:13:21,570 --> 00:13:24,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was just about to
set forth that Jutsu...</font>

148
00:13:29,740 --> 00:13:31,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't keep up with...</font>

149
00:13:31,580 --> 00:13:32,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">his Jutsu!</font>

150
00:14:23,710 --> 00:14:24,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's over...</font>

151
00:14:43,230 --> 00:14:44,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why...?</font>

152
00:14:45,230 --> 00:14:48,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you able to see into the future...?</font>

153
00:14:50,070 --> 00:14:50,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah...</font>

154
00:14:52,280 --> 00:14:53,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're going to die!</font>

155
00:15:19,270 --> 00:15:21,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You were right. He died.</font>

156
00:16:07,610 --> 00:16:09,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's definitely dead.</font>

157
00:16:14,530 --> 00:16:15,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I thank you.</font>

158
00:16:16,830 --> 00:16:21,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have been waiting for the chance
to kill Zabuza.</font>

159
00:16:25,330 --> 00:16:27,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">By the looks of that mask...</font>

160
00:16:27,540 --> 00:16:30,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're a Tracker Ninja from
the Village Hidden in the Mist.</font>

161
00:16:31,880 --> 00:16:34,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Impressive. You're very knowledgeable.</font>

162
00:16:36,260 --> 00:16:37,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tracker Ninja?</font>

163
00:16:37,350 --> 00:16:39,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You don't know what
a Tracker Ninja is?</font>

164
00:16:39,890 --> 00:16:41,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We learned it at
the Academy, didn't we?</font>

165
00:16:42,270 --> 00:16:43,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tracker Ninja pursue...</font>

166
00:16:44,350 --> 00:16:49,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">guys like Zabuza who turn against
the village where they were born and raised.</font>

167
00:16:49,440 --> 00:16:52,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And when they break away from
the village,</font>

168
00:16:52,400 --> 00:16:54,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tracker Ninja go after these Rogue Ninja
and assassinate them...</font>

169
00:16:54,780 --> 00:16:57,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in order to avoid having
the secrets of the village being leaked.</font>

170
00:16:58,410 --> 00:16:59,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's common knowledge!</font>

171
00:16:59,990 --> 00:17:01,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You should study more!</font>

172
00:17:03,410 --> 00:17:04,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right.</font>

173
00:17:04,410 --> 00:17:06,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm a member of Hidden Mist Village's
Tracking Unit</font>

174
00:17:07,210 --> 00:17:09,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">whose mission is to
hunt Rogue Ninja.</font>

175
00:17:10,550 --> 00:17:15,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">From his height and voice,
he's not all that different from Naruto...</font>

176
00:17:16,430 --> 00:17:17,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A Tracker Ninja...?</font>

177
00:17:25,440 --> 00:17:28,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's not just an ordinary kid...</font>

178
00:17:56,380 --> 00:17:58,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you?!</font>

179
00:18:06,980 --> 00:18:08,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey you!</font>

180
00:18:09,560 --> 00:18:12,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't worry, Naruto.
He's not an enemy.</font>

181
00:18:13,530 --> 00:18:15,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's not what I'm asking!</font>

182
00:18:15,900 --> 00:18:16,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I...!</font>

183
00:18:17,610 --> 00:18:19,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I mean...!</font>

184
00:18:19,110 --> 00:18:21,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Zabuza...
That Zabuza was killed!</font>

185
00:18:22,080 --> 00:18:24,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That guy who was so strong...</font>

186
00:18:24,950 --> 00:18:28,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He was killed so easily... by a kid
who's no different from me!</font>

187
00:18:29,170 --> 00:18:30,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're...</font>

188
00:18:30,670 --> 00:18:32,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're pathetic!</font>

189
00:18:35,550 --> 00:18:37,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't accept that!</font>

190
00:18:39,550 --> 00:18:40,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well!</font>

191
00:18:40,340 --> 00:18:42,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I understand your disbelief.</font>

192
00:18:43,180 --> 00:18:45,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But... this, too, is reality.</font>

193
00:18:51,190 --> 00:18:54,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In this world, there are kids
who are younger than you...</font>

194
00:18:55,530 --> 00:18:57,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and stronger than me.</font>

195
00:19:19,130 --> 00:19:23,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your battle is over for now.</font>

196
00:19:24,220 --> 00:19:27,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I must get rid of this corpse...</font>

197
00:19:28,020 --> 00:19:30,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">because it contains many secrets.</font>

198
00:19:32,980 --> 00:19:35,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now then, please excuse me.</font>

199
00:19:40,360 --> 00:19:41,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's disappeared!</font>

200
00:19:49,750 --> 00:19:51,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's not here anymore.</font>

201
00:19:56,500 --> 00:19:59,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What was all this for?!</font>

202
00:19:59,550 --> 00:20:03,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are we anyway?!</font>

203
00:20:05,760 --> 00:20:06,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

204
00:20:08,770 --> 00:20:12,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it! Damn it! Damn it!
Damn it! Damn it!</font>

205
00:20:15,270 --> 00:20:17,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Things like this happen
when you're a Ninja.</font>

206
00:20:18,690 --> 00:20:20,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you're frustrated,
apply it next time!</font>

207
00:20:27,450 --> 00:20:29,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Our mission hasn't ended yet.</font>

208
00:20:31,250 --> 00:20:33,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We must take Tazuna-san home.</font>

209
00:20:37,130 --> 00:20:39,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So sorry, everyone!</font>

210
00:20:39,630 --> 00:20:42,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You can rest at my house!</font>

211
00:20:43,180 --> 00:20:43,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay!</font>

212
00:20:44,180 --> 00:20:45,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's perk up and go!</font>

213
00:20:59,730 --> 00:21:00,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What!</font>

214
00:21:00,780 --> 00:21:01,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What happened!</font>

215
00:21:03,740 --> 00:21:04,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kakashi-sensei!</font>

216
00:21:12,910 --> 00:21:14,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kakashi-sensei!</font>

217
00:21:33,410 --> 00:21:36,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Cultivate your hunger before you idealize.</font></b></font></font></font>

218
00:21:36,790 --> 00:21:40,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Motivate your anger to make them all realize.</font></b></font></font></font>

219
00:21:40,250 --> 00:21:43,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Climbing the mountain, never coming down.</font></b></font></font></font>

220
00:21:43,420 --> 00:21:47,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Break into the contents, never falling down.</font></b></font></font></font>

221
00:21:50,600 --> 00:21:53,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">My knee is still shaking, like I was twelve.</font></b></font></font></font>

222
00:21:53,850 --> 00:21:57,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Sneaking out of the classroom, by the back door.</font></b></font></font></font>

223
00:21:57,190 --> 00:22:00,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">A man railed at me twice though, but I didn't care.</font></b></font></font></font>

224
00:22:00,650 --> 00:22:04,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Waiting is wasting for people like me.</font></b></font></font></font>

225
00:22:04,320 --> 00:22:07,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Don't try to look so wise.</font></b></font></font></font>

226
00:22:07,320 --> 00:22:10,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Don't cry 'cause you're so right.</font></b></font></font></font>

227
00:22:10,780 --> 00:22:14,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#e8e6bc">Don't dry with fakes or fears,</font></b></font></font></font>

228
