<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#dfe9ed">Don't cry 'cause you're so right.</font></b></font></font></font>

235
00:22:47,780 --> 00:22:50,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Dubai"><font size="40"><b><font color="#dfe9ed">Don't dry...</font></b></font></font></font>

236
00:22:52,600 --> 00:22:55,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">What'll we do?!</font>

237
00:22:55,310 --> 00:22:57,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Kakashi-sensei has collapsed!</font>

238
00:22:57,640 --> 00:23:01,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Gato's henchmen are probably
gonna come and attack us again!</font>

239
00:23:01,310 --> 00:23:03,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Guess it means we've gotta
fight by ourselves.</font>

240
00:23:04,070 --> 00:23:06,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Who knows if this training will
make us stronger but,</font>

241
00:23:06,530 --> 00:23:07,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">it's getting interesting!</font>

242
00:23:08,400 --> 00:23:10,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I'll definitely get stronger.</font>

243
00:23:11,780 --> 00:23:13,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Next time:
"The Forest of Chakra."</font>

244
00:23:13,830 --> 00:23:16,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I'm going to kick butt once again!</font>

